config RK806_NLDO1_2_3_SUPPLY
    string "NLDO1-3 input supply (VCC13) parent regulator name"
    default ""
    ---help---
        Name of the parent regulator that supplies the NLDO1-3 input rail
        (VCC13).  NLDO1, NLDO2 and NLDO3 share this input internally, so
        this single setting is used by all three.  Leave empty if VCC13
        is a fixed/battery rail.

